    "scenesThatPass": [
      "HILARY: Just stay quiet. They’ll go away.\nROSEMARY: Miss Small? Hilary? It’s Rosemary Bates here, Kent Social Services. We’ve met before.\nROSEMARY: Hilary? Could I come in, please?\nHILARY: Go now. Out the back.",
      "HILARY: You don’t get it, do you? I don’t want your fucking help. I’m not your patient. I’m not some problem to be solved.\nROSEMARY: Hilary, I’m afraid if you don’t open the door, we are going to have to force entry.\nHILARY: Go. Now.\nHILARY: Do I make myself clear? Do I?",
      "ROSEMARY: Hilary? Please open the door!\nHILARY: Oh, for goodness sake...\nHILARY: Just...go in there. And close the door.\nROSEMARY: May we come in?",
      "HILARY: Hello.\nRUBY: Hi.",
      "DELIA: Hello.\nDELIA: It’s okay, you don’t need to leave, I’m just doing last check-ups.\nHILARY: No, I should go... I’ve got stuff I need to do, and it’s late and I don’t want to be a bother.\nHILARY: Bye, then."
    ]
  },
